Package: arxistant
Version: @VERSION@
Section: science
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ArXistant contributors
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-numpy, python3-sklearn, python3-keyring
Recommends: systemd, chromium | google-chrome-stable
Description: Personalized local arXiv paper ranker and Chrome extension
 ArXistant fetches and ranks astronomy papers, stores a local paper library,
 and serves its browser interface on localhost for the bundled Chrome extension.
